# URLs the link checker cannot evaluate correctly. Each line is a regex.
# Keep the reason with the entry: an unexplained exclusion becomes permanent.

# MITRE ATLAS is a client-rendered single-page app. Deep links render correctly
# in a browser but the server answers 404 for any route below the root.
^https://atlas\.mitre\.org/(matrices|techniques)/

# iso.org answers 403 to non-browser user agents. The page is public and loads
# normally for a human.
^https://www\.iso\.org/standard/
